          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='14'>Category - Sales Per Customer (CY Vs PY)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='12'>This butterfly chart shows a comparison of sales CY and PY per customer. It is split into categories.In this book is the category where maximum sales is visible.</run>
